      "task_item": "",
      "content": "\nCreate a new FastAPI router file that exposes browser operations:\n- POST /api/browsers - Create a new browser session\n- GET /api/browsers/:session_id - Get browser session status\n- DELETE /api/browsers/:session_id - Close browser session\n\nThe endpoint should:\n1. Accept JSON payload with: name (str), url (str), headless (bool)\n2. Create a Browser instance via CODXJuniorSession.get_browser()\n3. Return session details with session_id and initial state\n4. Handle validation errors properly (return 422 with validation details)",
